<title>SWITZERLAND: Saurer mulls Berna, Graziano spinoffs.</title>
<headline>Saurer mulls Berna, Graziano spinoffs.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saurer Group Holding AG said it saw the possibility of spinning off and listing its Berna and Graziano divisions.</p>
<p>&quot;I could easily imagine bringing the Berna and Graziano businesses to the market in stages in the near future,&quot; chairman Ernst Thomke told a meeting of financial analysts. He did not elaborate.</p>
<p>Berna is the group's metallurgy division, while Italian-based Graziano makes transmissions.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
